# Premium Gardening & Landscaping Service Website

This document outlines the plan to build a high-end, dynamic website for an Indian gardening and landscaping service provider catering to major corporations (TCS, Reliance, L&T, Adani) and premier events (Lollapalooza, Sunburn).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Design Strategy Approval**: We will focus on a highly premium, modern aesthetic using deep greens, elegant typography, and smooth micro-animations. We will use Vanilla CSS for styling (as per guidelines) instead of TailwindCSS, aiming for a responsive and lightweight application. Do you have a specific Company Name in mind, or should I use a placeholder like "GreenScape India"?
> 
> **Technology Stack**: I propose using **React + Vite** for a fast, client-side rendered application that supports rich animations and responsiveness. 

## Proposed Changes

We will build the project from scratch in a new directory within the workspace.

### Core Application

- Initialize a new Vite + React project.
- Remove default boilerplate and set up a clean folder structure (`components`, `styles`, `assets`, `pages`).
- Implement SEO best practices with semantic HTML5 elements.

### Global Styles (`index.css`)

- Define a premium color palette (e.g., Deep Forest Green, Emerald, Off-white, Gold accents).
- Import modern typography (e.g., 'Inter' and 'Outfit' from Google Fonts).
- Create global CSS variables for colors, spacing, and transitions.

### Components

#### [NEW] `Navbar.jsx` & `Navbar.css`
Responsive navigation bar with smooth scrolling to sections.

#### [NEW] `Hero.jsx` & `Hero.css`
A high-impact landing section with dynamic text and a background showcasing premium landscaping. Will use the `generate_image` tool to create stunning, relevant background assets.

#### [NEW] `About.jsx` & `About.css`
Information about the company's scale and capability to handle pan-India corporate and event requests.

#### [NEW] `Services.jsx` & `Services.css`
Grid/Cards detailing services:
- Corporate Campus Maintenance
- Event Decor & Landscaping (Concerts & Corporate Events)
- Sustainable Weed & Pest Control
- Seasonal Planting

#### [NEW] `Clients.jsx` & `Clients.css`
A scrolling marquee or elegant grid showcasing major clients: TCS, Reliance, L&T, Adani, Lollapalooza, and Sunburn.

#### [NEW] `Contact.jsx` & `Contact.css`
A sleek, modern contact form for business inquiries.

#### [NEW] `Footer.jsx` & `Footer.css`
Standard footer with links, contact info, and legal text.

## Open Questions

> [!CAUTION]
> 1. Are there any specific brand colors or a specific logo you'd like me to incorporate?
> 2. Would you like a multi-page site or a single-page scrolling site (Single Page Application is usually best for a highly dynamic, modern "wow" factor)?

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` to ensure the project bundles successfully without errors.
- Ensure no console errors when running `npm run dev`.

### Manual Verification
- Visual inspection of the UI to ensure the design meets the "Rich Aesthetics" guidelines (vibrant colors, smooth gradients, hover effects).
- Responsive check on mobile, tablet, and desktop views.
- Test scroll behaviors and animations.
